                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left",
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Open AR = the Sage balance on every AR invoice not yet paid in full. Ageing counts days from the invoice date to the data date; AR > 60 DAYS adds the 61-90 and over-90 rows. A voided invoice keeps its whole amount as a balance in Sage - those are left out here (they were in the AR the Oct 30 call questioned). Retainage held is not in Sage AR; it sits on the Procore pay app.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontFamily": "Arial",
                      "fontSize": "8pt",
                      "color": "#16283F",
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
